Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 20:18:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] runtime: gate host copies by allocation semantics

Centralize ROCr H2D and D2H fast-copy eligibility. Only host-accessible allocations owned by the active GPU may use the CPU alias; dependencies, gang signals, profiling, D2D, private, peer, VMM, IPC and unsupported ranges retain the legacy blit path. Publish asynchronous completion with release ordering after memcpy.

